        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "From 11:00 to 12:00 Moscow time, work is underway on the infrastructure of the Yandex Cloud Backup service. At this time, VM and server connection operations to the service may be unavailable for a short time, and backup and backup policies may be managed through the service's user interface, CLI, and API. There may also be problems in starting and executing backup jobs.",
